        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>cell growth and/or maintenance</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2012-12-11T16:56:55Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
        <rdfs:comment>This term should not be used for direct annotation. It should be possible to make a more specific annotation to one of the children of this term.</rdfs:comment>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>single-organism cellular process</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
