        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>cell physiology</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <ns4:IAO_0000115>Any process that is carried out at the cellular level, but not necessarily restricted to a single cell. For example, cell communication occurs among more than one cell, but occurs at the cellular level.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
